        "created_at": "2014-09-06T00:16:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">I've got a card list too</a>, no acronym knowledge required.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The acronym knowledge is for the forums, not the card list <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Your card list will be exactly what I'm looking for soon, but first I have to learn the card text of all the cards.</p>",
