        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Zondebok\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/e480ec/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Zondebok:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Rabit wrote:&nbsp;</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;rick.mogstad wrote:<br><blockquote>Is there a way to change the display name in the forum from the auto-generated account name they gave me?&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nWhat alias do you want? Ask and we shall make it happen (assuming it isn't already claimed).And welcome to the community - glad to have you!  :slightly_smiling_face: \n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Zondebok, please. :)\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Done!</p>",
