        "created_at": "2014-09-09T23:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If people are concurring there's no \"snapshotting\", that's (inadvertenly) how people are saying Checmical Explosion works.</p><p>Far be it for me to disagree with the masses. (also, it's an awesome visual, the heroes look on in horror at the rising tide, scrambling to get high enough to escape the destructive wave. The Matriarch, unaware of the impending danger, sends her fowl in to attack the heroes, only for them to fall prey to the acid sea fast approaching, their twisted bodies fuel the surf, propelling it to an even greater height, one no one is safe from...)</p>",
